# In the Hall of the Mountain King, arranged for the Chiptune style.
# It starts slow and low and speeds up all the way to the end.
title: In the Hall of the Mountain King
composer: Edvard Grieg
arranger: Claude & SZ
about: From Grieg's music for Ibsen's play Peer Gynt (1875). Peer sneaks into the troll king's hall, and the same short theme repeats over and over, faster and louder, as the trolls close in.
year: 1875
source: public-domain
category: classics
style: chiptune
key: B minor
tempo: 96
time: 4/4

@bars 1-40 tempo=96..216

